    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The chess roguelike. Play game-changing cards, bend the rules, save your Queen, and escape from the dungeon.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609980/extras/f43d1a5ba0b8252db4926c3ccc1aecf1.avif?t=1755447196\" width=1532 height=466 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat opponents of ever increasing difficulty to escape from the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build</strong> your chess army. Start with just a few figures and recruit more as you go.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect</strong>  cards to turn the tides of the battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defeat</strong> each enemy Queen on your way to freedom.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609980/extras/185d1bb01c489371f68a642e57fc7f53.webp?t=1755447196\" data-has-big width=800 height=20 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609980/extras/cfc213006da3bde5ab56b11020d1f608.avif?t=1755447196\" width=1532 height=466 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play cards to bend the rules of the game in your favour and win against unbeatable opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609980/extras/36c41ba989e69d1d4e2bc93d349541b0.poster.avif?t=1755447196\" width=616 height=215 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609980/extras/36c41ba989e69d1d4e2bc93d349541b0.webm?t=1755447196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend mana to play cards such as:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon a <strong>Shape Shifter</strong> that transforms into a random figure each turn.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start a <strong>zombie outbreak</strong> - zombie figures do not care for the colour and attack white or black equally.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch an <strong>ICBM nuke</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build <strong>walls</strong> and <strong>traps</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch a <strong>propaganda campaign</strong> to turn enemy figures into your colour.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And many others!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609980/extras/185d1bb01c489371f68a642e57fc7f53.webp?t=1755447196\" data-has-big width=800 height=20 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609980/extras/9b13bbd25a40b6c1d8613b456d372939.avif?t=1755447196\" width=1532 height=466 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To win you either need to get smarter or to get stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every game you accumulate mana to buy new cards and chess pieces that stay with you in each new run.\u00a0<i>Maybe</i> you would even get a chance at escaping from the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609980/extras/a6eaf7d072786f06a939f72e02dab8ce.avif?t=1755447196\" width=1600 height=630 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some of your upgrades will persist between runs, helping you to get closer and closer to the exit. Some will reset with each new run, making each new game unique.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The chess roguelike. Play game-changing cards, bend the rules, save your Queen, and escape from the dungeon.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609980/extras/f43d1a5ba0b8252db4926c3ccc1aecf1.avif?t=1755447196\" width=1532 height=466 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat opponents of ever increasing difficulty to escape from the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build</strong> your chess army. Start with just a few figures and recruit more as you go.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect</strong>  cards to turn the tides of the battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defeat</strong> each enemy Queen on your way to freedom.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609980/extras/185d1bb01c489371f68a642e57fc7f53.webp?t=1755447196\" data-has-big width=800 height=20 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609980/extras/cfc213006da3bde5ab56b11020d1f608.avif?t=1755447196\" width=1532 height=466 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play cards to bend the rules of the game in your favour and win against unbeatable opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609980/extras/36c41ba989e69d1d4e2bc93d349541b0.poster.avif?t=1755447196\" width=616 height=215 ><source src=\"https://